se" bounds="[74,341][1006,465]" drawing-order="0" hint="" /><node index="1" text="Starting your day with a high-protein vegetarian breakfast can help stabilize energy levels, reduce cravings, and keep you feeling full until your next meal. Prioritizing protein in your first meal is an effective strategy for meeting your daily dietary needs and maintaining muscle mass. Here are some delicious and satisfying options to incorporate into your routine." resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="com.samsung.genuicraft" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[74,481][1006,847]" drawing-order="0" hint="" /><node index="2" text="" resource-id="" class="android.view.View" package="com.samsung.genuicraft" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[74,873][1006,2101]" drawing-order="0" hint=""><node index="0" text="Energizing Vegetarian Breakfast Ideas" resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="com.samsung.genuicraft" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[106,905][900,960]" drawing-order="0" hint="" /><node index="1" text="Option 1: Greek Yogurt Parfait | A quick and versatile option, layering protein-rich Greek yogurt with fruit and nuts is an easy way to get a substantial protein boost. A single cup of plain Greek yogurt can provide 15-20 grams of protein on its own." resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="com.samsung.genuicraft" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable=